Coverage: Actual diff inspected; related inverse/reland duplicate hunks checked as a chain.
Full four-file diff and current parser/POP sink boundary. POP passes one message at a time; mbox From separators must not restart this parser. Fixture has body From line; downloaded headers and database subject assertions independent. Body comparison has defect: expectBody assigned normalized gotBody, then compared to normalized gotBody. parseMessage also passes a regex-looking string to replace. Record test limitation without editing source. NS_ENSURE_STATE selected for member m_mailDB rather than argument guard.

